      Clue Unlock" and (history:)does not contain"Elena - Contract") and not ((history:)contains"Key
      Clue Unlock" and _interrogationAfterClue and (history:) does not contain "Elena
      - Key")
    text: '<i>You currently have no physical clues to present. Select a baseline
      topic for Detective Miller to press her on.</i>

'
    links: []
  - condition: 
    text: '

'
    links: []
